<view class="page">
  <view class="card friend-card">
    <view class="friend-title">我的八位导入码</view>
    <text class="friend-description">把导入码发给朋友，对方可导入你主动公开的资料。</text>
    <view class="import-code">{{contactCode || '加载中'}}</view>
    <button class="copy-button" bindtap="copyCode" disabled="{{!contactCode}}">复制导入码</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card permission-note">
    <view>公开资料</view>
    <text>先在个人隐私中公开昵称，再选择其他可公开字段。联系人、关系、电话和邮箱始终只保存在本机。</text>
    <button class="copy-button" bindtap="publish" loading="{{publishing}}" disabled="{{publishing || !profile || !profile.visibility.nickname}}">更新公开资料</button>
  </view>
</view>
